cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BLUM in research, cite the project repository and the exact commit evaluated."
title: "BLUM: Open-Source Financial Decision Intelligence"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BLUM Financial Lab"
    website: "https://github.com/SignalLayerLabs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SignalLayerLabs/Blum"
url: "https://blum.signallayerlabs.workers.dev"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - financial intelligence
  - quantitative finance
  - algorithmic trading
  - paper trading
  - financial machine learning
  - benchmark validation
  - equities
  - forex
abstract: >-
  BLUM is an evidence-bound financial decision intelligence system that records
  market theses, simulates paper execution, evaluates outcomes against relevant
  benchmarks and uses stored evidence to guide future research and confidence.

version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
